WEBVTT

00:13:56.799 --> 00:14:00.053
once suggested that we organize
Gay Humility Week.

00:14:00.077 --> 00:14:01.465
(Laughter)

00:14:01.489 --> 00:14:05.586
(Applause)

00:14:06.752 --> 00:14:07.943
It's a great idea.

00:14:07.967 --> 00:14:09.331
(Laughter)

00:14:09.355 --> 00:14:11.182
But its time has not yet come.

00:14:11.206 --> 00:14:13.167
(Laughter)

00:14:13.551 --> 00:14:18.569
And neutrality, which seems to lie
halfway between despair and celebration,

00:14:18.593 --> 00:14:20.285
is actually the endgame.

00:14:21.388 --> 00:14:23.831
In 29 states in the US,

00:14:24.211 --> 00:14:27.356
I could legally be fired or denied housing

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:28.705
for being gay.

00:14:29.352 --> 00:14:32.095
In Russia, the anti-propaganda law